    "text": "The English 30th Celebration Battle Deck led by Umbreon ex, released on 30 October 2026: a 60-card deck with a deck box, playmat and coin. Besides the set's Umbreon ex and an illustration rare-style Zeraora promo (MEP 103), every card is a reverse holo with the Pokémon 30th anniversary stamp, printing the number of its own set, among them the Toxel and Toxtricity of Phantasmal Flames and the Chi-Yu of Pitch Black.",
